---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
---

<SectionWrapper>
  <div class="container preview-panel preview-panel-alt">
    <div class="preview-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">CUOVO</p>
      <h2>Cuevo sits within E Deviser’s education focus.</h2>
      <p>We use the Cuevo initiative as a relevant education-facing product context and link to its public destination when more detail is available.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="preview-action">
      <Button href="/cuovo/" label="Learn about Cuevo" />
    </div>
  </div>
</SectionWrapper>
